This folder is what is left of the Agent Scheduler extension
(https://github.com/ArtVentureX/sd-webui-agent-scheduler), which was bundled
here in its "Agent Scheduler Neo" fork and replaced by the Remi Queue. Its
README states "This project is licensed under the Apache License 2.0"; the
repository has no LICENSE or NOTICE file and names no copyright holder. A copy
of the license is in LICENSE-APACHE-2.0 next to this file.

What remains: preload.py keeps the extension's command line flags
(--agent-scheduler-sqlite-file from the original preload.py, and
--agent-scheduler-trust-unsigned-params) so existing launch commands keep
working; its help texts and README.md were written for Remi.
